# ::tok Personal pension savings have the characteristics of long terms, high interest rates, and high safety, and are suitable for people with poor risk tolerance; personal pension insurance products focus on protection and are more suitable for people who cannot bear investment risks and can accept stable returns; while personal pension wealth management products and public fund products do not protect capital or income, have certain investment risks, but the expected returns are high, suitable for people with certain financial knowledge and high risk bearing ability.
