# ::tok The picture he sent to the reporter showed that the developer of the property promised that anyone who purchased the property between February 1 and February 28 from the date the two parties signed the purchase and sale contract until the delivery of the corresponding property, if the preferential discount for other properties in the project is greater than the discount previously enjoyed by the purchase of the house (limited to other unsold commercial properties of the same type, same building, same unit, and same property type as the commercial property), the developer can exchange the house for the buyer and refund the difference in price.
