# ::tok The MGTO organized a large-scale Hong Kong study tour of more than 100 people composed of representatives from the tourism department of the Hong Kong Government, the tourism industry and the media to Macau. In addition to working meetings and industry negotiations, representatives from the Hong Kong travel agency industry and media also visited various tourist attractions, hotels and tourism-related facilities in Macau in batches to introduce the latest Macau tourism products to the Hong Kong market while promoting cultural tourism linkages between the two places to jointly expand the “online travel” market between Hong Kong and Macao.
