# ::tok He said that it is necessary to thoroughly study and implement the spirit of General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech at the opening ceremony of the seminar, more firmly support the “two establishments”, resolutely carry out the “two maintenance”, strengthen our abilities, really work hard, solidly push forward all aspects of Chinese-style modernization, and create achievements that can stand the test of history, practice and people in comprehensively advancing the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation.
