# ::tok From January to September 2022, Singapore's tourism revenue totaled S$8.96 billion. It is estimated that tourism revenue for the full year of 2022 will reach S$13.8 billion to S$14.3 billion, an increase of 6 to 7 times over S$1.89 billion in 2021. It has returned to the level of about 50% to 52% before the COVID-19 pandemic in 2019.
