# ::tok According to the data, as of December 18, 2022, passenger traffic at Changi Airport has recovered strongly. It has received 150,000 passengers every day, about 1 million passengers per week, which is equivalent to about 75% of what it was before the COVID-19 pandemic. The number of employees working in the aviation industry has also returned to about 90% of the pre-pandemic level.
