# ::tok Liu Yiqian, head of business at the Shanghai Securities Fund Evaluation Research Center, told the reporter of the Economic Watch Network that investors can use the “Fund E Account” app to know all of their OTC public fund holdings in one stop to help them recover “forgotten assets”. More importantly, it has collected full account information on the investment status of comprehensive funds for customers, helping customers to better grasp their investment situation in a timely, accurate and complete manner, so as to better optimize their own fund portfolio allocations and better plan their own financial arrangements.
