# ::tok Objectively speaking, I have no evidence to prove that I didn't damage the product, but in terms of my Amazon shopping credit history, I don't think this kind of product should appear in Amazon's own products. Customers choose Amazon's own management is trust. Customer win, we win. The customer's victory is the manufacturer's victory. I hope everyone works together to improve it, thank you.
