# ::tok The first time I bought something on Amazon, I had a few different feelings. First, let's talk about the experience of using the product. The first one is really painless and doesn't have a pungent taste. Overall, it's very good. Wipe it off after about 8 minutes, but there will be a small amount of sweat residue on it, and you won't be able to see it if you don't take a close look, so overall it's good. As for the rest, you'll have to keep watching until you keep using it.
