# ::tok First of all, I'm looking forward to buying it. I think the Dole brand's one shouldn't be too bad. After I received it, I think it's OK. It's pretty good, but one of the boxes is basically soft, and I can't see it on the outside. If you eat it, it doesn't taste at all, it's light and tasteless. If you bite off the dark yellow color of the pulp, it's just bad. It's not even one-third of what you can eat. It's not cheap, the quality is so bad!
